1
00:00:00,091 --> 00:00:02,432
Welcome to the Somatic Healing Body Scan.

2
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:22,285
This practice invites you to listen to the body as a messenger of parts, protection, and emotion.

3
00:00:23,265 --> 00:00:24,926
It is not a medical assessment.

4
00:00:25,747 --> 00:00:27,668
It is a gentle awareness practice.

5
00:00:28,742 --> 00:00:30,303
Begin by getting comfortable.

6
00:00:31,264 --> 00:00:32,865
Let your body be supported.

7
00:00:34,206 --> 00:00:46,514
Take a slow breath in and let it out.

8
00:00:47,814 --> 00:00:49,936
Now bring attention to the top of your head.

9
00:01:03,176 --> 00:01:06,577
Notice any sensation there, no need to change it.

10
00:01:07,537 --> 00:01:13,318
Move attention to your forehead, your eyes, your jaw, your mouth.

11
00:01:14,338 --> 00:01:18,419
Notice softness, tension, numbness, or movement.

12
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:20,460
Now the throat.

13
00:01:21,720 --> 00:01:25,541
Ask, is there anything here that wants to be noticed?

14
00:01:38,664 --> 00:01:39,825
Move to the shoulders.

15
00:01:40,345 --> 00:01:41,765
Notice what they carry.

16
00:01:42,626 --> 00:01:43,606
Move to the chest.

17
00:01:44,186 --> 00:01:50,929
Notice breath, tightness, openness, heaviness, warmth or emptiness.

18
00:01:51,910 --> 00:01:53,050
Move to the stomach.

19
00:01:53,890 --> 00:01:57,672
Notice any holding, churning, contraction or ease.

20
00:02:08,007 --> 00:02:08,987
Move to the back.

21
00:02:09,708 --> 00:02:11,728
Notice support or strain.

22
00:02:12,649 --> 00:02:14,450
Move to the arms and hands.

23
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:22,513
Notice whether they want to reach, hold, push away, protect, or rest.

24
00:02:32,837 --> 00:02:35,678
Move to the hips, legs, and feet.

25
00:02:37,048 --> 00:02:39,230
Notice grounding or restlessness.

26
00:02:40,210 --> 00:02:43,573
Now choose one body area that called your attention.

27
00:02:44,814 --> 00:02:48,856
Ask, is there a part connected to this sensation?

28
00:03:02,026 --> 00:03:04,508
If yes, notice the part gently.

29
00:03:05,929 --> 00:03:06,369
If no,

30
00:03:06,856 --> 00:03:08,638
Simply stay with the body area.

31
00:03:09,799 --> 00:03:12,381
Ask, what do you want me to know?

32
00:03:25,713 --> 00:03:26,033
Listen.

33
00:03:45,253 --> 00:03:49,396
Ask, what would help you feel 1% safer?

34
00:04:02,466 --> 00:04:10,391
Maybe breath, warmth, space, movement, a hand nearby, a boundary, or a kind phrase.

35
00:04:11,332 --> 00:04:12,533
Offer that gently.

36
00:04:14,212 --> 00:04:16,793
Now notice if the sensation changes.

37
00:04:17,654 --> 00:04:18,474
It may soften.

38
00:04:19,414 --> 00:04:20,335
It may increase.

39
00:04:21,235 --> 00:04:21,995
It may move.

40
00:04:22,936 --> 00:04:24,136
It may stay the same.

41
00:04:25,537 --> 00:04:27,258
All of that is okay.

42
00:04:28,918 --> 00:04:30,599
Thank your body for communicating.

43
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:34,481
Thank any parts that allowed themselves to be noticed.

44
00:04:35,581 --> 00:04:36,682
Take a slow breath in.

45
00:04:46,885 --> 00:04:47,806
and let it out.

46
00:04:48,807 --> 00:04:49,928
Return to the room.

47
00:04:59,976 --> 00:05:05,281
Carry with you the reminder that the body can be listened to with patience, not force.
